{"4228630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "QUIET", "steam_appid": 4228630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4890520], "detailed_description": "<h1>DON'T FORGET TO WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/ccbfc0a90396f265251928a875c62ff8.poster.avif?t=1786600058\" width=800 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/ccbfc0a90396f265251928a875c62ff8.webm?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/ccbfc0a90396f265251928a875c62ff8.mp4?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QUIET is a 1–4 player online co-op horror game where you and your crew play as alien ducks who crash-landed on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The good news: the ship parts you need are inside that house. The bad news: the homeowner can hear every sound your flock makes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound matters. <u>Microphone required.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/befc0f968cf3cd17ddfdc133f34a0423.poster.avif?t=1786600058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/befc0f968cf3cd17ddfdc133f34a0423.webm?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/befc0f968cf3cd17ddfdc133f34a0423.mp4?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE EVERYTHING THAT ISN’T NAILED DOWN </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the house for ship components. Move carefully. Don't grab more than you can carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And for the love of the mothership — don't knock anything over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/936803dc93ffde273e0714308c4f1186.poster.avif?t=1786600058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/936803dc93ffde273e0714308c4f1186.webm?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/936803dc93ffde273e0714308c4f1186.mp4?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHHHHHHHHHHHH </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement creates noise. Talking creates noise. Panic definitely creates noise. All real-world sounds carry risk. Stay QUIET…the homeowner is listening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/1f959f2b2fd5873c10e018d5b7ea7914.poster.avif?t=1786600058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/1f959f2b2fd5873c10e018d5b7ea7914.webm?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/1f959f2b2fd5873c10e018d5b7ea7914.mp4?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON’T GET CAUGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival requires teamwork, communication, and staying calm under pressure. Unfortunately, you are all alien ducks with terrible survival instincts. One mistake doesn't just cost you — it costs everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QUIET is a 1–4 player online co-op horror game where you and your crew play as alien ducks who crash-landed on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The good news: the ship parts you need are inside that house. The bad news: the homeowner can hear every sound your flock makes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound matters. <u>Microphone required.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/befc0f968cf3cd17ddfdc133f34a0423.poster.avif?t=1786600058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/befc0f968cf3cd17ddfdc133f34a0423.webm?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/befc0f968cf3cd17ddfdc133f34a0423.mp4?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE EVERYTHING THAT ISN’T NAILED DOWN </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the house for ship components. Move carefully. Don't grab more than you can carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And for the love of the mothership — don't knock anything over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/936803dc93ffde273e0714308c4f1186.poster.avif?t=1786600058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/936803dc93ffde273e0714308c4f1186.webm?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/936803dc93ffde273e0714308c4f1186.mp4?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHHHHHHHHHHHH </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement creates noise. Talking creates noise. Panic definitely creates noise. All real-world sounds carry risk. Stay QUIET…the homeowner is listening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/1f959f2b2fd5873c10e018d5b7ea7914.poster.avif?t=1786600058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/1f959f2b2fd5873c10e018d5b7ea7914.webm?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228630/extras/1f959f2b2fd5873c10e018d5b7ea7914.mp4?t=1786600058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON’T GET CAUGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival requires teamwork, communication, and staying calm under pressure. Unfortunately, you are all alien ducks with terrible survival instincts. One mistake doesn't just cost you — it costs everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Your ship crashed, your crew is stranded, and this house is somehow your best chance of survival. Search for ship parts while every movement and real-world sound risks alerting the homeowner. Stay QUIET, keep your flock together, and try not to quack under pressure.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamst